# PaperKid sample project: commit the SOURCE (Project.xml, Sources/, Content/*.xasset);
# ignore generated output + per-user editor state, which the tools regenerate.

# Pipeline cache: incremental-cook hash DB (cook.db) + rendered thumbnails.
/.cache/

# Cooked-resource output DB (regenerated from Content/ by cooking).
/Cooked/

# Editor dock layout / UI state (per-user, rewritten on open).
/Editor/
